{"id":"dae024f0-8f38-4186-a020-bf5c264a5890","title":"Decypher 5","slug":"decypher-5","collectionSlug":"decypher","collectionName":"Decypher","category":"logo","categoryZh":"文字特效","description":"A three-dimensional WiFi symbol rendered with a sophisticated glass material effect against a pure black background. The symbol consists of three stacked curved segments that decrease in size from bottom to top, creating the classic WiFi icon shape. Each segment features a translucent blue-tinted glass material with a subtle bevel and depth, giving them a dimensional, almost crystalline appearance. The glass surfaces exhibit strong refraction properties with visible light distortion and a fresnel effect that creates bright highlights along the edges, particularly visible as light blue-white glows. The interior surfaces of the glass segments display a complex layered effect combining multiple shader effects: a satin fabric texture with directional anisotropic highlights in light blue tones, a kaleidoscopic pattern creating geometric symmetry within the shapes, grid-based distortion creating a subtle warped effect, pixelation creating a digital granular texture, and chalk-like markings with light blue strokes on the dark surfaces. A CRT screen effect overlays the entire composition with scanlines and pixel grid artifacts, adding a retro-digital aesthetic with subtle color shifting. The overall mood is futuristic and technological, with cool blue and cyan tones contrasting against the deep navy and black base colors. The lighting creates a sense of depth and dimensionality, with the fresnel effect making the glass appear to glow from within.","colors":["#000000","#2a3a52","#9ab8d4","#a8c8e8","#b8d4f0"],"labels":["3d","glowing","retro","dark"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/dae024f0-8f38-4186-a020-bf5c264a5890.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"SolidColor","id":"idmv4n7yq56wwrg2use","_key":"key_1791772729997_0.703230077082715","props":{"color":"#000000","opacity":1,"mask